OL,3,GNEWSAResults awaited in Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounting has begun across the Isle of
OL,7,FMan in the 2026 general election, with
OL,8,Fresults expected to be declared
OL,9,Fthroughout the evening and into the
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,12,FThere are 82 candidates contesting the
OL,13,Felection for the 24 seats available in
OL,14,Fthe House of Keys.
OL,16,FExit polls conducted by Manx Radio
OL,17,Fpredict seven outgoing MHKs will lose
OL,18,Ftheir seats, three of whom are current
OL,19,Fmembers of the Council of Ministers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
