OL,3,GNEWSAResults awaited in Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey suggest outgoing Environment, Food
OL,7,Fand Agriculture Minister Clare Barber,
OL,8,FEducation, Sport and Culture Minister
OL,9,FDaphne Caine, and Enterprise Minister
OL,10,FTim Johnston have lost their seats.
